<html xmlns:o="urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office"
  xmlns:w="urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:word"
  xmlns="http://www.w3.org/TR/REC-html40">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<title>文档</title>
<!--[if gte mso 9]>
<xml>
  <w:WordDocument>
    <w:View>Print</w:View>
    <w:Zoom>100</w:Zoom>
  </w:WordDocument>
</xml>
<![endif]-->
<style>
body { font-family: '宋体', SimSun, serif; margin: 2.54cm; }
p { margin: 0 0 6pt 0; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 1.6; }
h1 { font-size: 22pt; font-weight: bold; }
h2 { font-size: 16pt; font-weight: bold; }
h3 { font-size: 14pt; font-weight: bold; }
table { border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; }
td, th { border: 1px solid #000; padding: 4pt 8pt; font-size: 12pt; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<p style="font-size:12pt;line-height:1.6;">FormatConverter offline QA<br/>中文内容：文件转换可用性验证<br/>Numbers: 20260801, 42, 3.14<br/>Symbols: &lt;tag&gt; &amp; &quot;quoted&quot;</p>
<p style="font-size:12pt;line-height:1.6;">Second paragraph.</p>
</body>
</html>